sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor D as Donatur (Klien)
    participant UI as TrustGive Web UI
    participant API as Backend (Go Gin)
    participant ZK as ZK Prover / Verifier
    participant P as Paillier Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant SC as Smart Contract (EVM)

    D->>UI: Input nominal donasi (v)
    UI->>API: Request submit donasi (Header: Idempotency-Key)
    API->>ZK: Pembangkitan secret salt (s), komitmen Poseidon(v, s), & bukti rentang Groth16
    ZK-->>API: Komitmen C_zk dan ZK Proof (pi_a, pi_b, pi_c)
    API->>P: Enkripsi nominal Paillier: c = g^v * r^n mod n^2 (r acak CSPRNG)
    P-->>API: Ciphertext Paillier (c)
    API->>DB: INSERT donasi status 'pending' (Atomik)
    API->>SC: Transaksi recordDonation(campaignId, commitment, encryptedAmount, proof)
    Note over SC: Verifikasi on-chain via Groth16Verifier (alt_bn128)
    SC-->>API: Transaksi confirmed on-chain & Tx Hash
    API->>DB: UPDATE donasi status 'confirmed' & simpan Tx Hash
    API->>DB: Akumulasi homomorfik saldo total kampanye
    API-->>UI: Respon transaksi sukses & Receipt Hash
    UI-->>D: Tampilkan notifikasi & tautan bukti transaksi
